{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00496",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.8,
      "end_seconds": 3.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Good evening. Sorry to keep you waiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 3.96,
      "end_seconds": 9.25,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "Doctor, um, I've come along because I know the history, if it helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.74,
      "end_seconds": 17.14,
      "duration_seconds": 6.4,
      "text": "Of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here. Is the form from the front desk all filled in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.63,
      "end_seconds": 22.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "I think so, I handed it in at the counter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.94,
      "end_seconds": 24.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "How can I help you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 26.35,
      "end_seconds": 32.56,
      "duration_seconds": 6.21,
      "text": "Okay, uh, so it's hives, doctor. He didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.08,
      "end_seconds": 36.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.14,
      "end_seconds": 50.93,
      "duration_seconds": 13.79,
      "text": "For about two weeks, I'd say. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. Oh, you know, and welts that move around. That's been about the same, about four days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.68,
      "end_seconds": 54.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Have you had swelling of the lips?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.5,
      "end_seconds": 61.69,
      "duration_seconds": 7.19,
      "text": "Yes, actually. Well, as for swelling of the lips, a five out of ten, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.66,
      "end_seconds": 65.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "One moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.11,
      "end_seconds": 66.85,
      "duration_seconds": 0.74,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.61,
      "end_seconds": 80.75,
      "duration_seconds": 7.14,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Let me check a few things. Any joint pain, wheezing, throat tightness or new medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.81,
      "end_seconds": 86.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "Well, no, no joint pain, wheezing, throat tightness or new medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.99,
      "end_seconds": 89.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Right, has there been any trouble breathing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.2,
      "end_seconds": 95.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Right, uh, no, I haven't had any trouble breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.84,
      "end_seconds": 98.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Has there been any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.81,
      "end_seconds": 101.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "No fever, thank goodness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 102.11,
      "end_seconds": 107.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "So, actually, doctor, I did notice fever. He doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.97,
      "end_seconds": 112.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.7,
      "end_seconds": 121.16,
      "duration_seconds": 7.46,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.37,
      "end_seconds": 124.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Yeah, no, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.79,
      "end_seconds": 126.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.03,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.67,
      "end_seconds": 129.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.43,
      "end_seconds": 135.95,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.93,
      "end_seconds": 154.54,
      "duration_seconds": 17.61,
      "text": "I have eczema. I took the morning off to come in today. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help. Um, I've had COPD, yes. It's the not knowing that gets to me. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.07,
      "end_seconds": 158.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.32,
      "end_seconds": 174.76,
      "duration_seconds": 15.44,
      "text": "I mean, I take hydrocortisone cream, when needed. Tiotropium inhaler, once a day for my chest. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot. Cetirizine. I take it 10 milligrams, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 175.32,
      "end_seconds": 181.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.65,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the cetirizine was 5 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.37,
      "end_seconds": 185.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Hm. Do you have the latest prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.1,
      "end_seconds": 190.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Okay, so I don't think I have it with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.65,
      "end_seconds": 195.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.87,
      "end_seconds": 208.73,
      "duration_seconds": 11.86,
      "text": "Yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.15,
      "end_seconds": 210.87,
      "duration_seconds": 0.72,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.47,
      "end_seconds": 215.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "I used to smoke but I quit five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.4,
      "end_seconds": 219.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.97,
      "end_seconds": 223.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "I gave up drinking about three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.93,
      "end_seconds": 227.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.08,
      "end_seconds": 232.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "My sister has epilepsy. My sister has thyroid problems."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.53,
      "end_seconds": 247.81,
      "duration_seconds": 14.28,
      "text": "Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.96,
      "end_seconds": 250.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.85,
      "end_seconds": 255.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.63,
      "end_seconds": 258.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "No, nothing I'm aware of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.3,
      "end_seconds": 262.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.47,
      "end_seconds": 270.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.04,
      "end_seconds": 289.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 121 over 80, pulse is 72 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.72,
      "end_seconds": 293.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 293.67,
      "end_seconds": 294.43,
      "duration_seconds": 0.76,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.31,
      "end_seconds": 303.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.15,
      "end_seconds": 308.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.16,
      "end_seconds": 309.86,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.12,
      "end_seconds": 314.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "A little pressure here, tell me if it's tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.31,
      "end_seconds": 325.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "There are raised pink welts on the chest and back, some joined together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.99,
      "end_seconds": 328.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Breathe in deeply... and out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.7,
      "end_seconds": 344.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Lips look a little puffy, but the tongue and throat are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 345.34,
      "end_seconds": 346.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Okay, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 352.73,
      "end_seconds": 376.11,
      "duration_seconds": 23.38,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. Okay, so my impression is this: This looks most like acute urticaria, possibly allergic. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. I'd also keep a drug reaction in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 377.0,
      "end_seconds": 381.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 383.24,
      "end_seconds": 397.84,
      "duration_seconds": 14.6,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with acute urticaria, possibly allergic do well once it's treated properly. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had hives for about two weeks, and no new medicines or throat tightness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 399.34,
      "end_seconds": 401.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 402.78,
      "end_seconds": 410.6,
      "duration_seconds": 7.82,
      "text": "I'm going to order an allergy test, for recurrent urticaria. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 411.87,
      "end_seconds": 415.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Oh, um, alright. When can I do that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 418.74,
      "end_seconds": 430.45,
      "duration_seconds": 11.71,
      "text": "Let's get blood tests, for urticaria. I'll start you on prednisolone, 20 milligrams, once a day, for three days. That's for hives. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 431.04,
      "end_seconds": 433.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Alright, I'll pick it up today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 434.81,
      "end_seconds": 446.84,
      "duration_seconds": 12.03,
      "text": "Write down anything new you ate, took or used before this started, even small things. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 447.15,
      "end_seconds": 458.85,
      "duration_seconds": 11.7,
      "text": "Go on. Don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 460.01,
      "end_seconds": 461.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 462.94,
      "end_seconds": 473.58,
      "duration_seconds": 10.64,
      "text": "If your lips or tongue swell more, or you have trouble breathing, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department. Come back in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 474.98,
      "end_seconds": 475.68,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 478.85,
      "end_seconds": 482.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "Okay, summarise it for me, what's the plan from your side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0071",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 483.94,
      "end_seconds": 492.19,
      "duration_seconds": 8.25,
      "text": "So, I take the prednisolone, 20 milligrams, once a day and come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0072",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 492.65,
      "end_seconds": 497.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Wonderful, I think that's it. Ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0073",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 498.34,
      "end_seconds": 500.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "No, you've explained it well. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}